DEFRAG11.ZIP  ARM Disk Optimizer v1.1 - NEW!  Sysop's pick
 | Months of saving, deleting and saving again leave your files in
 | pieces all over the platter, and the heads spend their days
 | commuting.  DEFRAG puts every file back in one piece, end to end,
 | and you get to watch the disk map fill in while it works.
 | DEFRAG.EXE + DEFRAG.DOC + FILE_ID.DIZ.  UNZIP DEFRAG11.ZIP, read
 | the DOC, back up first (you know the drill).  Makes a slow
 | disk fast again: the best 26K you'll download this year.
TERM.EXE      TERM 1.0 comm program: ANSI-BBS, dialing
              directory, ZMODEM/YMODEM/XMODEM.  Latest version!
ARMINFO.EXE   System info for the ARM/AT + CPU benchmarks
POPUP.COM     Pop-up desk accessories.  Try Ctrl+Alt+P!
              Calculator, notepad, ASCII table, over anything.
